 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Distance Threshold:** The threshold $vwidth/2$ is critical. Points exactly at the boundary are excluded. If the point cloud is sparse, many voxels may become `NaN`. [S1, unofficial]
-*   **Precision:** Floating-point precision in distance calculations may affect which point is selected as the nearest neighbor in dense regions. [G]
-*   **Empty Voxels:** Voxels with no points within $vwidth/2$ will have `NaN` values. Downstream processing must handle `NaN` appropriately. [S1, unofficial]
