 ## Background
-This method is described in the context of point cloud voxelization using Python (numpy & scipy) [S1, unofficial]. It is presented as a simple alternative to histogramming for assigning attribute values (like intensity) to voxel grids. The approach leverages the `scipy.spatial.cKDTree` for efficient nearest neighbor search.
